{"book":"daniel","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:40:26.424200673Z","verse":15,"ref":"daniel 3:15","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":3,"translation":"Now if you are ready, that at the time you hear the sound of the horn, pipe, lyre, trigon, psaltery, bagpipe, and all kinds of music, you fall down and worship the image that I have made — ⟨good⟩. But if you do not worship, at that moment you shall be cast into the midst of a burning fiery furnace. And who is the god that shall deliver you out of my hands?”","tokens":[{"surface":"כען","gloss":"Now"},{"surface":"הן","gloss":"if"},{"surface":"איתיכון","gloss":"you are ready"},{"surface":"עתידין","gloss":"ready"},{"surface":"די","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"בעדנא","gloss":"at the time"},{"surface":"די","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"תשמעון","gloss":"you hear"},{"surface":"קל","gloss":"the sound"},{"surface":"קרנא","gloss":"of the horn"},{"surface":"משרוקיתא","gloss":"pipe"},{"surface":"קיתרס","gloss":"lyre"},{"surface":"שבכא","gloss":"trigon"},{"surface":"פסנתרין","gloss":"psaltery"},{"surface":"וסומפניה","gloss":"and bagpipe"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"and all"},{"surface":"זני","gloss":"kinds"},{"surface":"זמרא","gloss":"of music"},{"surface":"תפלון","gloss":"you fall down"},{"surface":"ותסגדון","gloss":"and worship"},{"surface":"לצלמא","gloss":"the image"},{"surface":"די","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"עבדת","gloss":"I have made"},{"surface":"והן","gloss":"but if"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תסגדון","gloss":"you worship"},{"surface":"בה","gloss":"⟨in⟩"},{"surface":"שעתה","gloss":"that moment"},{"surface":"תתרמון","gloss":"you shall be cast"},{"surface":"לגוא","gloss":"into the midst"},{"surface":"אתון","gloss":"furnace"},{"surface":"נורא","gloss":"of fire"},{"surface":"יקדתא","gloss":"burning"},{"surface":"ומן","gloss":"and who"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"is"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"that Elah"},{"surface":"די","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"ישיזבנכון","gloss":"shall deliver you"},{"surface":"